OL,3,GNEWSACracking voice, Gromit: Dog to
OL,4,Aspeak at last
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe's graced our screens for almost 40
OL,7,Fyears, but has never said a word -
OL,8,Funtil now.
OL,10,FSince 1989 Gromit, the animated dog
OL,11,Ffrom Bristol's Aardman Animations, has
OL,12,Fshared adventures with his
OL,13,Fcheese-loving owner Wallace, from
OL,14,Fspaceflight to being pursued by robotic
OL,15,Fgarden gnomes.
OL,17,FAnd now Gromit, created by Nick Park,
OL,18,Fwill speak for the first time in an
OL,19,Faudiobook voiced by actor Martin
OL,20,FFreeman.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
