OL,3,GNEWSACracking voice, Gromit: Dog to
OL,4,Aspeak at last
OL,5,
OL,6,FPark said the actor, who rose to fame
OL,7,Fin The Office and went on to star in
OL,8,Fthe BBC Drama Sherlock and films such
OL,9,Fas Love Actually and The Hobbit, was
OL,10,F"the obvious choice really."
